# thedev-sommet: ssh alias of the TOP machine (the control plane, always on).
# Copy this file to "thedev-sommet" (without .example) and put the ssh alias of YOUR top machine.
# Fleet-wide constant: same value on all your machines (versioned, symlinked).
# Machines SYNC UP their workspace cards + reports to it (`sync-up`); the top machine aggregates them.
# A single alias, must work as "ssh <alias>". Empty/missing => cross-machine off.
my-vps
